   "title": "$J$",
   "text": "$$J=\\frac{1}{4}\\left[\\ln \\frac{2+u}{2-u}\\right]_{-1}^{1}=\\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\ln 3-\\ln \\frac{1}{3}\\right)=\\frac{1}{2}\\ln 3$$",
   "uses": [
    "C1"
   ]
  },
